    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Dewebkiller Store Style Customizer for WooCommerce allows you to easily customize key design elements like:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Change primary color (default violet)</li>\n<li>Adjust button border radius</li>\n<li>Style quantity buttons</li>\n<li>Set global font family</li>\n<li>Choose from built-in preset themes</li>\n<li>Live preview with WordPress Customizer</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All changes are reflected live on your WooCommerce frontend without touching code.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Settings <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Style Switcher to start customizing</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"how%20do%20i%20access%20the%20settings%3F\">\nHow do I access the settings?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Go to WooCommerce <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Settings <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Style Switcher tab.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20work%20with%20any%20theme%3F\">\nDoes this work with any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it works with most themes that use standard WooCommerce templates.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20reset%20back%20to%20defaults%3F\">\nCan I reset back to defaults?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, by deleting the saved values or re-setting manually.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release with:\n<ul>\n<li>WooCommerce settings integration</li>\n<li>Live preview (Customizer)</li>\n<li>Preset themes</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Customize the look and feel of your WooCommerce store right from the WooCommerce settings tab.",
    "description": "<p>Dewebkiller Store Style Customizer for WooCommerce allows you to easily customize key design elements like:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Change primary color (default violet)</li>\n<li>Adjust button border radius</li>\n<li>Style quantity buttons</li>\n<li>Set global font family</li>\n<li>Choose from built-in preset themes</li>\n<li>Live preview with WordPress Customizer</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All changes are reflected live on your WooCommerce frontend without touching code.</p>\n",
